  "interpretation_boundary": "Measurements compare independent host-PDC-compensated Ableton exports of the installed Fresh Air VST3 over one deterministic 72-second fixture. They establish the active neutral boundary, isolated 21% Mid Air and High Air transfer, level/peak consequences, stereo consistency, fitted-tone residuals, and the host-reported zero-latency state at 48 kHz. Triangular dither prevents a bit-perfect null. The fitted-tone residual is a screening metric rather than THD because some fixture tones are harmonically related and the processor is dynamic. The experiment does not establish Trim calibration, Link behavior, every knob setting, transient-only material, VST2 parity, other sample rates, CPU cost, or musical preference."
